                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1121 Wong Bock Yue/13: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-06-28T16:00:00+08:00">June 28, 1930—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 6:10 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>514. Department’s 216, June 17 [<hi rendition="#italic">27</hi>], noon [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">6 p.m.</hi>] Demand presented at 4 p.m. today.</p>
                <closer>For the Minister:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Perkins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
